{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_068550","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，怎么办？要是Peace Walker的核弹朝Mother Base发射……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"冷静点。MSF正在全力阻止这种事发生。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"可是……Peace Walker的导弹弹头有1Mt<R=级,CLASS>。仅仅火球直径就超过1.5公里。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=级,CLASS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"强烈的热辐射会让爆心附近的物体蒸发。还有时速数百公里的冲击波、火灾，以及……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"初始核辐射造成的大剂量照射，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"没错。一个人都活不下来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"这种事我知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"听着，博士。那是你造出来的兵器。你应该比任何人都清楚它的威力。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"先冷静下来，从科学角度估算损害。一旦发生核爆炸，就不再只是MSF自己的问题。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"说得对……抱歉，我竟然慌成这样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"就像刚才说的，Mother Base会全灭，周围的船只也可能被波及。必须提前发出警告。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"另外，麻烦的是<R=放射性沉降物,FALLOUT>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=放射性沉降物,FALLOUT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"“<R=死之灰,FALLOUT>”……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=死之灰,FALLOUT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"如果在海上爆炸，产生的颗粒会比陆上爆炸更细，死之灰会随风被带到更广的范围。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"海水中的盐分会成为凝结核形成云层，再让含有死之灰的雨降到下风处……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"嗯，我亲身体会过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"在比基尼环礁？确实，<R=1954年的试验,CASTLE BRAVO>中，死之灰一直降到下风约500公里的范围。听说许多居民和船只都遭受了辐射。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=1954年的试验,CASTLE BRAVO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":168,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"Peace Walker的核弹头威力没那么大，但沉降状况也会受到天气很大影响，不能低估。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"……如果乘上信风，下风处就是哥斯达黎加。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"Coldman还轻描淡写地说什么“会多些人手”，根本不是那么回事。他对核武的认识太天真了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":121,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"如果淋到含有高浓度死之灰的雨，仅仅外部照射就可能造成大量死亡。雨水还会渗入土壤，污染饮用水和农作物。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":150,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"如果再把这些东西吃进体内，接下来就是内部照射。锶-90和铯-137的半衰期约30年，影响会持续一生。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"白血病、白内障、皮炎、癌症……生殖能力也会受到影响。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"………是啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"二战过去快30年了，可直到现在，仍有很多人受原爆症折磨。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"不能为了Coldman所谓的“实证试验”，再制造更多这样的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"……听起来也许很矛盾，但我制造Peace Walker，本来就是为了不让这种事再次发生。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"明白了，博士。无论如何都要阻止Peace Walker。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""}]}